                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How large is the Dubai + Abu Dhabi jewelry market?</h3>
                                        <p>Largest GCC market by consumption. UAE gold consumption per capita is 8-10x India. Deira Gold Souk alone is the world's largest gold retail concentration. Combined UAE jewelry market is USD 6-8 billion annually with 5-8% YoY growth.</p>
                                        <h3>What languages should Dubai + Abu Dhabi jewelry creative be produced in?</h3>
                                        <p>Trilingual: Arabic (Emirati + GCC national + Arab expat), English (Western + international expat), Hindi + Malayalam + Tamil (South Asian diaspora). Native-speaker + culturally-accurate creative required. Agencies without trilingual capability cannot serve UAE jewelry brands effectively.</p>
                                        <h3>When are the peak jewelry-buying periods in UAE?</h3>
                                        <p>Ramadan + Eid al-Fitr + Eid al-Adha (moving lunar calendar), Dhanteras + Diwali + Karwa Chauth (Hindu diaspora, Oct-Nov), Dubai Shopping Festival (Dec-Feb), UAE National Day (Dec 2), wedding season year-round. Calendar-plan 6-8 weeks pre-peak.</p>
                                        <h3>What compliance essentials must UAE jewelry brands handle?</h3>
                                        <p>ESMA (Emirates Standardization) hallmarking + purity, Kimberley Process for diamonds, UAE Federal + Emirate 5% VAT, DMCC free-zone regulations for DMCC-based brands, cross-border shipping + duty handling. See our <a href="/resources/how_to_launch_jewelry_d2c_brand_in_dubai_gcc.php">Dubai + GCC launch playbook</a>.</p>
                                        <h3>Is Snapchat important for UAE jewelry marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes for Arabic-speaker + young Emirati demographic. Snapchat has strong penetration in UAE + KSA + Kuwait Arabic-speaker demographic. Different platform mix from India (where Instagram + Meta dominates). Agencies must have Snapchat creative + ads capability for UAE.</p>
                                        <h3>What is a realistic agency retainer for a UAE jewelry brand?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 1.5-4 lakh / month (AED 6,500-17,500) for Starter-to-Growth (UAE brands typically at higher tier due to higher AOV + market economics). Rs 4-10 lakh / month (AED 17,500-43,500) for Enterprise + luxury. Ad spend separate + typically AED 20,000-200,000 / month depending on tier.</p>
                                        <h3>Does ITD have Dubai + Abu Dhabi jewelry work?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes. Published city-specific jewelry marketing playbooks for Dubai + Abu Dhabi + Jeddah + Doha + Dammam + Al Khobar under our GCC jewelry vertical work. Client references available under NDA on discovery call. See <a href="/services/gcc/dubai-jewellery-agency.php">Dubai jewellery agency page</a> for the Dubai-specific playbook.</p>
                                        <h3>Can ITD support cross-border expansion from UAE to Saudi + India + international?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes. GCC expansion via existing city-specific work in Riyadh + Jeddah + Dammam + Al Khobar + Doha. India expansion via India jewelry vertical work. International (USA + UK) expansion via GCC + international courier + cross-border work. Multi-region campaigns + trilingual creative + regional-payment-gateway + regional-carrier setup.</p>
